WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Start at the TritonAI homepage. Choose Learn.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Training, resources, and learning pathways in one place.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Open the TritonAI Discovery Series.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Browse short lessons on tools, privacy, and responsible use.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Choose a lesson: What is AI?

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Play a short excerpt of the lesson.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Test your understanding with the knowledge check.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Each answer provides feedback and an explanation.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Review your quiz result, then discuss it with your team.
